1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Tapai le kahile sochnu bhayeko cha? AI le kasari hamro question bujh-era answer dincha?

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Kasari ChatGPT jasto AI le text lekhna, question answer garna, ra naya ideas dina sakcha?

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Yo sabai bujhna, hami aaja LLM bata suru garchhau.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
LLM ko full form ho Large Language Model.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Simple words ma, yo AI ko ek type ho, jasle dherai text bata language ko patterns sikeko huncha.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Tespachi, yo learned patterns use garera human language ma response generate garna sakcha.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
LLM ko core idea language ko patterns learn garnu ho.

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Training ko bela model le dherai text bata words, sentences, grammar, ra context bich ko relationship sikcha.

9
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:25,000
“The sun rises in the...” bhanda model le “east” jasto word likely predict garna sakcha. Tara yo simple copy-paste machine matra hoina.

10
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Jaba tapai prompt dinuhuncha, jastai “Explain gravity simply,” model le input text lai tokens ma process garcha.

11
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Token bhaneko whole word, word ko part, wa aru text unit huna sakcha.

12
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Neural network le context ra learned patterns process garcha. Model le next token ko probability estimate garcha.

13
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Decoding process anusar token select garcha. Yo process repeat huda response step by step generate huncha.

14
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Training bhaneko model lai data bata patterns sikhaune process ho. Training ko bela model ko parameters adjust hunchan.

15
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Inference bhaneko trained model lai use garera question ko response generate garne process ho.

16
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Training ma model prepare huncha; inference ma tapai uslai question sodhnu huncha.

17
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:55,000
LLM le education ma concept explain garna, writing ma help garna, coding ma suggestions dina sakcha.

18
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Language translate garna, ra long information summarize garna pani sakcha. Yo learning ra productivity ko lagi useful tool ho.

19
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:20,000
Tara result check garnu, aafno judgement use garnu, ra important kaam ma blindly trust nagarnu ramro.

20
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:31,000
LLM le confident answer diye pani answer sadhai correct huncha bhanne chaina.

21
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Kahile kahi wrong facts, outdated information, wa made-up details dina sakcha.

22
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Fluent answer dekhidai ma tyo true huncha bhanne hudaina. Important information reliable sources bata verify garnu parcha.

23
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:07,000
LLM bhaneko large amounts of text bata language patterns learn garne AI model ho.

24
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:17,000
Yo input lai tokens ma process garcha, context use garcha, ra next tokens generate gardai response banaucha.

25
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Aba tapai lai LLM ko basic concept clear bhayo hola. Yo AI learning journey ko first step ho. Subscribe garnu hola!
